trace.request:
Please perform and document:  
- Presence or absence of generalized muscle rigidity (test passive movement of upper/lower limbs, jaw, and neck for sustained resistance);  
- Any spontaneous muscle activity (e.g., tremor, myoclonus, dystonic posturing).

